<title>GERMANY: HOECHST DETAILS H1 RESULTS.</title>
<headline>HOECHST DETAILS H1 RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>FRANKFURT 1997-08-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to June 30</p>
<p>(in millions of marks unless stated)</p>
<p>    Group net income			   743     vs 1,836</p>
<p>    Group pre-tax profit		     2,003   vs 4,320</p>
<p>    Group operating profit		   2,270   vs 2,775</p>
<p>    Group net sales			    27,886  vs 26,091</p>
<p>NOTE - Full name of the German chemicals group is Hoechst AG. The company noted that results for the year-earlier period were boosted by extraordinary income from disposals.</p>
<p>--Frankfurt Newsroom, +49 69 756525</p>
</text>
